gRj7_H6hFo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHxy1DQisX84x1dvoqUHh-6brgEfIEeLZjsLtqan9u_jw&oe=6A92BCD6"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2021-03-01-15h23m34s811.png", "id": "774992679776878", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982720_774992683110211_8478148152978643142_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LZXXZarO77oQ7kNvwFekAkC&_nc_oc=AdqjmwcYN2AXSakJtsmXN4SeTrdDD3GoBjt0xM7I5yPiu1IM7choncrktsVaKv6SJaI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHDW_H0JQd9IoNVZSYmKnpc5l5baHKpS9qdUevtd5xU8A&oe=6A92C3A7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SportModeLandscapeCover.png", "id": "1250535798673645", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974827_1250535802006978_4125075686671892505_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o_n7UWU-moAQ7kNvwHbBySb&_nc_oc=AdoCNeqi2xn5pHlFFneOzBjGNV5WnBpQ37WbPGrjHYxYN9eu68-BCU3RSASRvfjAIWQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGPgl1KIyGfQN4BGW3F82ypCA2UwRVAL8bzvhTYuYdu0A&oe=6A92C76A"}, "display_name": "Sport Mode", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Successor to the hugely popular Physics Playground, Sport Mode takes it to the next level in a game where your creativity is the limit.\n\nSport Mode is currently in Early Access with a Sandbox mode where you have access to Creator Mode, a button press away from spawning and manipulating a variety of weapons, NPCs, and props. Also available is an Arena mode where you fight off waves of enemies for the highest score.\n\nComing soon is a Puzzle mode where you have to solve physics-driven puzzles in the fastest time possible.\n\nLeaderboards will be coming later so you can compete with your friends.", "short_description": "Successor to the hugely popular Physics Playground, Sport Mode takes it to the next level in a game where your creativity is the limit."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://